{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to <u><strong>WISHLIST!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/4ca38c3d094221a34a0ceee4505c6b7b.poster.avif?t=1774624505\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/4ca38c3d094221a34a0ceee4505c6b7b.webm?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/4ca38c3d094221a34a0ceee4505c6b7b.mp4?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has taken you prisoner. Your house was burned, and your mother, your only family, executed under his commands. But you committed no crime\u2026 What does he want from you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE ELVISH CASTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/5808d334111796aab6973f529b62ce1e.poster.avif?t=1774624505\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/5808d334111796aab6973f529b62ce1e.webm?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/5808d334111796aab6973f529b62ce1e.mp4?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through the majestic rooms of Velendar castle and find your way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/faae39396565a4621679846326887fd8.poster.avif?t=1774624505\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/faae39396565a4621679846326887fd8.webm?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/faae39396565a4621679846326887fd8.mp4?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe and use logic to solve each escape room so you can advance. Clues and hints are everywhere - keep an eye open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE FROM THE KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/884ab8f7b1bc16afde625ef6432ee11b.poster.avif?t=1774624505\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/884ab8f7b1bc16afde625ef6432ee11b.webm?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016880/extras/884ab8f7b1bc16afde625ef6432ee11b.mp4?t=1774624505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He imprisoned you without a reason\u2026 or could he have one?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight escape rooms filled with puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016880?t=1774624505","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016880?t=1774624505","cap